@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Node a owl:Class.
hpc:resumeprogram a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:slurmresumefile a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:Partition a owl:Class.
hpc:oversubscribe a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:Reservation a owl:Class.
hpc:nodesalloc a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:nodesresume a owl:ObjectProperty.

rdfs:domain hpc:Resumeprogram hpc:Node.
rdfs:domain hpc:Slurmresumefile hpc:Resumeprogram.
rdfs:domain hpc:Nodesalloc hpc:Resumeprogram.
